<title>ALGERIA: Algeria&quot;s voter turnout 56.02 percent at 1700 GMT.</title>
<headline>Algeria&quot;s voter turnout 56.02 percent at 1700 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>ALGIERS 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algerian Interior Minister Mustapha Benmansour said 56.02 percent of Algeria's 16.8 million voters had cast ballots by 6 p.m. (1700 GMT) on Thursday in the country's general election.</p>
</text>
